-- on_surface_variant, outline, primary, secondary, tertiary, error); the
-- remaining four (on_primary, primary_container, on_primary_container) plus
-- surface_variant serve the editor's own UI chrome — cursorline, selection
-- and statusline backgrounds — that the ramp does not compute.
